  "derivation": "0.2.1 shipped no id array — ids were added in 0.3 (docs/124 T2). The ids below are todays generated kDirectoryIds, which is sound because the directory ROWS are byte-identical between the tag and this commit. Reproduce: git show open-radio-0-2-1:firmware/generated/station_catalog.hpp | awk '/kDirectory\\[\\] = \\{/,/^\\};/' and diff against the same range of the current header — the diff must be empty.",
